<title>USA: Tricord hires advisor to weigh options.</title>
<headline>Tricord hires advisor to weigh options.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH, Minn. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tricord Systems Inc said Tuesday it retained Smith Barney Inc to assist in evaluating and recommending future options for the company.</p>
<p>Tricord said its options to be considered could consist of strategic alliances, an equity investment, a merger or the acquisition of the company.  </p>
<p>Tricord Systems designs, manufactures, markets and supports the PowerFrame Enterprise Server for use in mission-critical software applications.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
